; A phantom must never show an icon anywhere, so it points at the one cell of
; ui_icon_equipment.dds that is guaranteed empty: (20,0), GS's blank base slot -- the same cell the
; layer-composed weapons park their own inv_grid on (see w_ak74.ltx). Its alpha is 0 across the
; whole cell AND across its neighbours, so nothing bleeds in under filtering.
; It used to be 5000,5000: off the atlas entirely, which is not "invisible" but "whatever the
; sampler's clamp happens to give you".
